        en: { name: 'Russky Bridge', description: 'A cable-stayed bridge across the Eastern Bosphorus Strait with a 1,104-metre main span, one of the longest in the world. It leads to Russky Island, home to the Far Eastern Federal University campus, coves and the Primorsky Aquarium.', tip: 'The best view of the bridge is from the university campus waterfront, especially in the evening when it is lit up.' },
